WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.250
Doctor, could you explain what you are doing?

2
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:06.000
I am marking some injection points.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
For this patient, I intend to

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.500
inject a mesogel called EJAL 40,

5
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.500
which could perhaps be considered
an analogue of Profhilo.

6
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.500
There are some small differences.

7
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.750
We inject at five points on each side.

8
00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.500
Here there are four points on each side,
and they are called

9
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.250
BIOREVITALIZATION POINTS.

10
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:38.250
Both of these types of mesogels
are injected into a layer and

11
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.000
provide a degree of lifting

12
00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:44.250
and deep hydration.

13
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.250
Many people ask about their differences:

14
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.750
which is better, Profhilo
or Jalupro Super Hydro?

15
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.500
The layers are different,
the purposes of

16
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.500
the injections are different,
and

17
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.000
the two cannot be compared.
